DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering R. Levi Yitzchak Schneerson\, 
 whose Yahrzeit occurs on Saturday\, August 12\, corresponding to the 20th 
 of Av\, 5788.\n\nR. Levi Yitzchak Schneerson’s Yahrzeit begins at sundow
 n on Friday\, August 11 and continues until sundown on the day of observan
 ce. It is customary to light a memorial candle before sundown as the Yahrz
 eit begins.\n\nMay your loved one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eter
 nal life and may their memory serve as a continued source of inspiration a
 nd comfort to you.\n\nhttps://www.hebcal.com/yahrzeit/edit/01jmt1hef19p1hw
 6qn48k8p4z9#row21
